title: "DeVill - The Digital Deserted Medieval Villages Archive of the Austrian Society for Medieval and Modern Archaeology. Metadata Dataset of Archaeological Objects and Archive Files"
version: 1.0
date-released: 2026-09-09
url: "https://devill.oegmn.or.at"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  DeVill provides open online access to the digitised deserted villages archive of the ÖGMN. 
  The data aggregates legacy documentation created since the early 1970s together with newly 
  created digital outputs. In this repository, the metadata of the project is made available 
  in human- and machine-readable formats.
